Location/Check/ArtifactOwners: Check the location: an artifact is unique and has one owner (field owner has several entries)
Location/Check/ArtifactTwice: Check the location: an artifact is unique and lies in one place only (field location has several entries)
Location/Check/Cycle: Check the location: its parents form a cycle
Location/Check/LedAndLocation: Check the location: the field location names a location the field leader already holds; whoever controls a location is present there too
Location/Check/LocationTwice: Check the location: a location lies in one place only (field location has several entries)
Location/Check/LockedParent: Check the location: its parent is hidden from someone who can see this location
Location/Check/NotALocation: Check the location: the field location names a tiddler that is not a location
Location/Check/OwnerAndLocation: Check the location: an artifact has an owner or a location, not both; whoever had it before goes to former
Location/Check/PersonTwice: Check the location: a person has one location; someone who moves around gets the surrounding region
Location/Check/SpotAndLocation: Check the location: it is a spot of another location and has a field location
Location/Check/SpotTwice: Check the location: it is a spot of several locations
