Section/Check/DateLabel: Check the text: <<date "$text$">> - the first parameter is the number of a section, a caption goes into label:"$text$"
Section/Check/Inside: Check the text: a short form <<$macro$>> inside another block does not count - use the block form there
Section/Check/NestEmpty: Check text: <<$macro$>> marks nothing - the text follows the marker in its paragraph
