Section/Check/QuestStatus: Check text: "$status$" is no status of a quest (open, complete, failed)
Section/Check/SecretMidText: Check the text: <<secret>> in the middle of a section has no effect - put it at the start of the section, or use <$secret>…</$secret>
Section/Check/WrongType: Check the text: <<$macro$>> counts only in a tiddler tagged $type$
